WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.140
Some medical images show the shape
of a bone or organ in fine detail.

2
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.380
But shape can't tell you how
well a kidney is working,

3
00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.770
or whether blood reaches every
part of the heart muscle.

4
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.980
So how can a hospital picture
what an organ is doing,

5
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.980
not just what it looks like?

6
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.410
In this mission, you'll
build a camera with no lens,

7
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.190
layer by layer.

8
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:27.640
Then you'll see how a computer turns
thousands of tiny flashes into an image.

9
00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:32.290
Your mission: explain how a hospital
can picture what an organ is doing,

10
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.570
not just its shape.
